BT /F1 10 Tf 14 TL 50 800 Td (Regulatory Circular Summary) ' (Synthetic, illustrative summary for the LoanLens AI hackathon demo. Not legal text.) ' (1. Purpose) ' (Summarises regulatory expectations Kestrel Bank follows for retail loans.) ' (2. Key Fact Statement) ' (A Key Fact Statement with all-in cost must be given to the borrower) ' (before the loan agreement is signed.) ' (3. Foreclosure on Floating Rate Loans) ' (No foreclosure or prepayment charges on floating rate term loans) ' (to individuals for non-business purposes.) ' (4. Reasons for Rejection) ' (Reasons for rejecting a loan application must be communicated to the applicant in writing.) ' (5. Digital Lending Disbursal) ' (Loan amounts are disbursed directly into the borrower's own bank account.) ' (6. Penal Charges) ' (Penal charges are not added to the interest rate and are not capitalised.) ' () ' ET
